{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"More on the Ganges River, Etc.","html":"<article id='sn46.131-142'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Saṁyutta Nikāya 46.131–142 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Linked Discourses 46.131–142 </span></li>\n<li><span class='root'>14. Punagaṅgāpeyyālavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>14. Another Chapter of Abbreviated Texts on the Ganges </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='sutta-title'><span class='root'>Punagaṅgānadīādisutta </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>More on the Ganges River, Etc. </span></h1></header>\n<p><span class='root'>…pe… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='endvagga'><span class='root'>vaggo cuddasamo. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<p class='uddana-intro'><span class='root'>Uddānaṁ </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p>\n<blockquote class='uddanagatha'><p><span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Cha pācīnato ninnā, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>cha ninnā ca samuddato; </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>Dvete cha dvādasa honti, </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span>\n<span class='verse-line'><span class='root'>vaggo tena pavuccatīti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></span></p></blockquote>\n<p class='expansion-instructions'><span class='root'>(Bojjhaṅgasaṁyuttassa gaṅgāpeyyālaṁ rāgavasena vitthāretabbaṁ.) </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>(Tell in full as in SN 45.103–114, removal of greed version.) </span></p></article>"}
